OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council appoints
OL,4,ARicky Bell as new leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow City Council has elected Ricky
OL,7,FBell as the new leader of the local
OL,8,Fauthority.
OL,10,FBell was previously depute leader and
OL,11,Freplaces Susan Aitken, who announced in
OL,12,FMay that she was to stand down.
OL,14,FThe Govan councillor has been leader of
OL,15,Fthe city's SNP group since Aitken left
OL,16,Fthe position in May, and has also
OL,17,Fserved as the city's treasurer since
OL,18,F2020
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
