OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow City Council appoints
OL,4,ARicky Bell as new leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told BBC Scotland News earlier this
OL,7,Fmonth that it was unfair Glasgow
OL,8,Fcouncil tax payers are "carrying the
OL,9,Fburden" of housing refugees for the
OL,10,F"whole of Scotland".
